<h2>Product description</h2>

<p>The Opentrons Flex® HEPA/UV Module is a positive-pressure clean air and ultraviolet (UV) disinfectant accessory for the Flex liquid handling robot. It contains a mesh pre-filter, a HEPA filter, and two UV lights. Running the module’s filtration and lighting for 15 minutes creates an ISO-5 clean bench environment within the Flex enclosure.</p>
